        "candidate_id": "C_706e0dfe95edbef9_0",
        "edit": "No change: the supplied buggy RTL already matches the oracle behavior for the observed mismatch (actual@cycle0 got 00000001, expected 00000000), so no local repair is applicable within the frozen scope.",
